Physical memory maximum capacity is displayed incorrectly

[Issue Description]
MaxRankCapacity was set to 16 to reflect the maximum rank
capacity for a 32Gb x8 memory - 16GB (according to PTL MC HAS).
It turned out that the maximum capacity calculation was not
taking into account the fact that this value does not reflect
an entire x64 SO-DIMM.

[Resolution]
For the SMBIOS calculations, we need to multiply the rank size by 2
in order to get both x32 channels of a x64 SO-DIMM.

